  ./scripts/adlc5 patterns lookup --id gof/strategy [--frontmatter]
  ./scripts/patterns/lookup.sh ...   # same tool

Prints matching concept id + path only (optional short frontmatter). Never dumps card bodies.
""",
        file=stream,
